a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c88a7243-871f-4bc9-98b3-634691e32860\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c88a7243-871f-4bc9-98b3-634691e32860\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a table in the <a href=\"/wiki/Cloister_of_Sombre_Embrace\" title=\"Cloister of Sombre Embrace\">Cloister of Sombre Embrace</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-378&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-1678</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A roster of five infiltrators is written in an elegant hand. Above their names, it is noted that this group have proven themselves to be the most skilled, and have the greatest chance of successfully obtaining the artefact, but they remain utterly expendable.]\n</p><p>Caldan Darkwood - Leader\n</p><p>Buddug Vriss - Close Combat\n</p><p>Kurk Deepcroft - Lockpicking\n</p><p>Dreena Covely - Languages\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a> - Healer\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Another copy of this text exists, in a red book, using the same icon, simply labeled \"Book\", in a stack of books on a table in the Infiltration Training room in the <a href=\"/wiki/Cloister_of_Sombre_Embrace\" title=\"Cloister of Sombre Embrace\">Cloister of Sombre Embrace</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-331&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-1594</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nocturne\" title=\"Nocturne\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Nocturne.png/25px-Portrait_Nocturne.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Nocturne.png/38px-Portrait_Nocturne.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Nocturne.png/50px-Portrait_Nocturne.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nocturne\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Nocturne.png/25px-Portrait_Nocturne.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Portrait_Nocturne.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nocturne\" title=\"Nocturne\">Nocturne</a> tells a story about <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/38px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/50px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a> receiving a scar on her elbow from a collision with Buddug Vriss' teeth.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214120\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2163/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35609/4194304 bytes\n